                                                "sense_id": "3c76da12-cab5-39fb-a8e5-236158804df9",
                                                "text": "Paul: Give the Harkonnen a blade and let him stand forth.\nShaddam IV: If Feyd wishes, he can meet you with my blade in his hand."
                                            }
